event-outcome-producer:

Responsibility:
1) Get [event outcome] via REST endpoint.
2) Put the [event outcome] in Kafka Topic.

Glossary:
[event outcome] - Sporting event result. In the JSON form. Is represented by: Event ID, Event Name, Event Winner ID

/---------------------/
event-matcher-worker:

Responsibility:
1) Consume [event outcome] from Kafka Topic.
2) For each [event outcome] produce 1+ [unit of work].
3) Put [unit of work] in RocketMQ topic.

Glossary:
[bet] - a sporting bet, that contains :Bet ID, User ID, Event ID, Event Market ID, Event Winner ID, Bet Amount
[unit of work] - an object derived from an one [event outcome] and 1+ linked [bet].
 In the JSON form. Is represented by: Unit ID, Event ID, Task Type

/---------------------/
bet-settler-worker:

Responsibility:
1) Consume [unit of work] from RocketMQ Topic.
2) For each [unit of work] produce 1+ [settled bet].

Glossary:
[settled bet] - a bet that has been processed and its outcome determined.
 In the JSON form. Is represented by: Settled Bet ID, Bet ID, User ID, Event ID, Event Market ID, Event Winner ID, Bet Amount, Settlement Status